                                                    <span class="inclassAccTitle">Strategy</span>
                                                </span>
                                                <svg class="inclassAccCaret" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                                                    fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                                                    <path transform="translate(2.75 6.5)" d="M13.5 1L7.25 7.25L1 1"
                                                        stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
                                                        stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                                                </svg>
                                            </button>

                                            <div class="inclassAccBody">
                                                <div class="inclassAccBodyInner">
                                                    <div class="classList">
                                                        <span class="classDot"></span>
                                                        <p class="classListPara">How can organizations design strategies
                                                            and
                                                            drive transformation using structured thinking and data?</p>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="classList">
                                                        <span class="classDot"></span>
                                                        <p class="classListPara">How do strategic archetypes emerge and
                                                            how
                                                            should firms choose among them?</p>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>

