                                            <div class="inclassAccBody">
                                                <div class="inclassAccBodyInner">
                                                    <div class="classList">
                                                        <span class="classDot"></span>
                                                        <p class="classListPara">How do companies structure processes to
                                                            deliver speed, cost, and quality trade-offs?</p>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="classList">
                                                        <span class="classDot"></span>
