                                                <div class="inclassAccBodyInner">
                                                    <div class="classList">
                                                        <span class="classDot"></span>
                                                        <p class="classListPara">How can individuals use AI tools to
                                                            improve
                                                            productivity and decision-making?</p>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="classList">
                                                        <span class="classDot"></span>
                                                        <p class="classListPara">How does AI adoption create advantage
                                                            versus parity or wasted investment?</p>
