                                        d="M18.2837 9.41647L7.28 6.04147C7.13107 5.99803 6.97407 5.98983 6.82142 6.01754C6.66878 6.04524 6.52467 6.10808 6.4005 6.20109C6.27633 6.2941 6.1755 6.41472 6.10599 6.55341C6.03648 6.69211 6.00019 6.84508 6 7.00022V16.0002C6 16.2654 6.10536 16.5198 6.29289 16.7073C6.48043 16.8949 6.73478 17.0002 7 17.0002C7.09562 17.0003 7.19076 16.9866 7.2825 16.9596L12.5 15.3583V16.0002C12.5 16.2654 12.6054 16.5198 12.7929 16.7073C12.9804 16.8949 13.2348 17.0002 13.5 17.0002H15.5C15.7652 17.0002 16.0196 16.8949 16.2071 16.7073C16.3946 16.5198 16.5 16.2654 16.5 16.0002V14.1315L18.2837 13.5846C18.4902 13.5226 18.6712 13.3958 18.8002 13.2231C18.9292 13.0504 18.9992 12.8408 19 12.6252V10.3752C18.9991 10.1598 18.929 9.9503 18.8 9.7777C18.6711 9.60509 18.4901 9.47846 18.2837 9.41647ZM12.5 14.3127L7 16.0002V7.00022L12.5 8.68772V14.3127ZM15.5 16.0002H13.5V15.0515L15.5 14.4377V16.0002ZM18 12.6252H17.9931L13.5 14.0052V8.99521L17.9931 10.3702H18V12.6202V12.6252Z"
